## 8. Cleanup between scenarios

```bash
# Confirm loadtest.py fully exited and cleaned its temp files
ps -ef | grep loadtest
df -h /tmp

# Reset pgbench's own accounting between scenario runs if comparing tps directly
sudo -u postgres psql -d bankforge -c 'SELECT pg_stat_reset();'
```

Always `Ctrl+C` `loadtest.py` and confirm it has fully exited (it cleans up
its own `/tmp` files and terminates children on `KeyboardInterrupt`) before
starting the next scenario — running two `loadtest.py` instances
simultaneously without intending to will double every contention effect and
make your before/after numbers meaningless.

